 r←SecretQueryParms
⍝ Names of the query parameters whose values are taken to carry credentials, in upper case.
⍝ Their values never make it into a crash report: see `SaveCrashRequest`.
⍝ `[TRAP]MaskQueryParms` in the INI file adds to them: see `EstablishSecrets`.
 r←'ACCESS_TOKEN' 'API_KEY' 'APIKEY' 'AUTH' 'KEY' 'PASSWORD' 'PWD' 'SECRET' 'TOKEN'
